OL,3,GNEWSAWoman dies in two-car crash near
OL,4,Arugby club
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman has died and three other people
OL,7,Fwere taken to hospital after a crash
OL,8,Finvolving two cars in Staffordshire.
OL,10,FParamedics were called to Burntwood Way
OL,11,Fin Burntwood, near Lichfield, at 17:35
OL,12,FBST on Wednesday.
OL,14,FThree ambulances and an air ambulance
OL,15,Fwere sent to the location near
OL,16,FBurntwood Rugby Club.
OL,18,FA fifth person was assessed and
OL,19,Fdischarged at the scene.
